          "media": {
            "alt": {
              "segmentId": "m00320:alt:fig-00002-alt",
              "text": "Diethylacetamidomalonate reacts with sodium ethoxide and ethyl-2-bromoacetate to form a triester. This reacts with hydronium ion in the presence of heat to form (R, S)-aspartic acid in 55 percent yield"
